        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS33U,  3\" x 3\" Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching Stainless Steel flathead, Phillips Drive #9 x 3/4 inch wood screws. The 3 x 3 x Square Corners Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge is fitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. The Deltana SS33U utilizes a template screw hole pattern and can be used on wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS33U.jpg?v=1704354615\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS33U Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3 Inch Heavy Duty Stainless Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.097\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #9 x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS33Ux.pdf?v=1704262169\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS33 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
